# Git Safety

- Never run destructive git commands unless explicitly asked (`reset --hard`, `checkout --`, force push).
- Never amend existing commits unless explicitly requested.
- Never change git config in this repo from agent workflows.
- Prefer small, reviewable commits grouped by task intent.
- Do not commit generated artifacts (`target/`, screenshots, logs, cache files).

# Commit Hygiene

- Verify changes with targeted tests before commit when possible.
- Keep commit message focused on why, not a file-by-file changelog.
- If hooks/tests fail, fix code before retrying commit.
